"program_narrative": "Program PORTDEL is a batch program that deletes portfolio master records on request. It reads deletion requests sequentially from DELETE-FILE (key = portfolio ID + account number, plus a reason code), looks each portfolio up by key in the indexed PORTFOLIO-FILE, deletes it, and writes an audit record (timestamp, action 'DELETE', key, reason code, portfolio status) to AUDIT-FILE. The main loop performs 2000-PROCESS until DELETE-FILE reaches end of file. Key business operations include: keyed lookup of the portfolio, physical deletion of the portfolio record, audit trail creation for every successful deletion, and counting deleted, not-found and failed requests, which are displayed at termination. Error conditions handled: file open failure (return code 8), portfolio not found (status '23'), other read errors, delete failure and audit write failure; record-level errors are counted and displayed but do not change the return code.",
"paragraphs": [
  {"name": "0000-MAIN", "section": null, "paragraph_id": "SYS-PORTFOLIO-001-FIL-0068-PAR-0001", "section_id": null, "line_range": [101, 110],
   "pseudocode": [
